convicted of a sexual offense as set out in § 40-39-202(20) or a violent sexual offense as set out in § 40-39-202(31) shall be
required to register for life. Information concerning the violent juvenile sexual offender who commits a subsequent offense listed
in § 40-39-202(20) or § 40-39-202(31), which was formerly considered confidential under § 40-39-206(e), shall be deemed
public information.
