minor. For purposes of this paragraph, the term “sexual offense” means any offense listed in division (a)(10)(B)(i) or (a)(10)
(B)(iv) through (a)(10)(B)(xix) of Code Section 42-1-12;
(4) Has completed all prison, parole, supervised release, and probation for the offense which required registration pursuant to
Code Section 42-1-12 and meets the criteria set forth in subparagraphs (c)(1)(A) through (c)(1)(F) of Code Section 17-10-6.2;
or
(5) Was convicted of a sexual offense and required to register under the laws of another state or territory, under the laws of
the United States, under the Uniform Code of Military Justice, or in a tribal court and:

